<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Persimmon: third-party licences</title>
<style>
body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f2f0; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
li { margin: 0.1rem 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>Persimmon is free software under GPL-3.0-or-later. It's built from the Rust crates, libraries and interface packages below, each under the licence shown. FFmpeg and ffprobe are bundled as separate programs; their sources, with FFmpeg's configure line, are attached to each release.</p>
<h2>Rust crates</h2>
<h2>Licences used</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
<!-- more -->
</body>
</html>
